{"id":"00153","root":"uni00153_1","name":{"ja":"フェリシア","en":"Felicia"},"title":{"ja":"【初空】","en":"【First Sky】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【初空】 フェリシア","en":"【First Sky】 Felicia"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Undead"],"release":"2018-12-31","limited":true,"characterId":35,"profile":{"ja":"魔族。 忌まわしき魔道実験の末に生まれた“真祖”の血を引く少女吸血鬼。血統上の“父”であるエドウィン・ブラックの寵愛を独占しようと求め、自身を生み出した母体となった女性――“母”と、同時期に生み出された“姉妹”を抹殺した。魔界から召喚した人の背丈ほどの大鎌“メアリー・ベル”と、切りつけたものを全て腐らせる影の刃を使役する。ヴァンパイアハーフの対魔忍・心願寺紅との死闘に敗れ、修復不能の傷を負って闇の中に姿を消す。その後の消息は杳として知れない。","en":"(Felicia, she/her) A demon. She is a vampire girl born as a \"prime ancestor\" after a cursed magical experiment, bearing the blood of the original source. Seeking to monopolize the affection of her bloodline \"father\" Edwin Black, she eliminated the woman who served as her mother's vessel and the \"sisters\" created at the same time. She summons a human-sized great scythe called \"Mary Bell\" from the Demon Realm and commands a shadow blade that rots anything it cuts. After a deadly duel with the vampire-half Taimanin Shinganji Kurenai, she suffered irreparable wounds and vanished into darkness. Her whereabouts remain unknown."},"illustrator":"ZOL","voiceActor":"木多野あり","forms":[{"id":"uni00153_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[824,1648],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[105,211],"def":[93,186],"spd":[69,69],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["2","80009"]},{"id":"uni00153_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1248,2496],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[160,321],"def":[136,272],"spd":[69,69],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["2","80009","80010"]},{"id":"uni00153_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1672,3345],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[215,432],"def":[179,359],"spd":[69,69],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["2","80009","80010"]}],"skills":{"2":{"slot":"attack","id":2,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{