:"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"あらこんばんは、いい夜だね。ふぇりは今いい気分だから、特別に殺さないであげる♪","en":"Oh, good evening, what a nice night. Feri's in a good mood, so I'll spare you… just this once♪"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00153_1/uni00153_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"あけましておめでとう？　やっぱり人間って変だよね。新しい年になっただけでお祝いするなんて","en":"Happy New Year? Humans are weird, huh? Celebrating just because it's a new year."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00153_1/uni00153_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"あはっ☆　人間って、こういうバカみたいな格好を見ると興奮するんでしょ？","en":"Ahah☆ Humans get all excited when they see this kind of stupid outfit, don't they?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00153_1/uni00153_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"ふひっ♪　ひまだから、特別にふぇりがあなたの相手をしてあげる。光栄でしょ？","en":"Fuhih♪ I'm bored, so Feri will entertain you specially. Honored, right?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00153_1/uni00153_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"ふぇりを楽しませて？　退屈させたりしたら、殺しちゃうから☆","en":"You gonna entertain Feri? If you bore me, I'll kill you☆"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00153_1/uni00153_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"正月って本当にすることがないのね。暇つぶしに、人間でも殺しに行こうかしら","en":"New Year's really has nothing to do… maybe I'll go kill some humans for fun."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00153_1/uni00153_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"人間なんてみんなゴミみたいに見えるけど、おにいさんはちょっと違う気がする","en":"Humans all look like trash, but big brother seems a bit different."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00153_1/uni00153_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"あははっ☆　おにいさんと遊ぶの、楽しいねっ！　もっと遊ぼう？","en":"Ahaha☆ Playing with you, big brother, is fun! Want to play more?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00153_1/uni00153_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio